ent kind, for example Next, which means, that the next messages will be returned to the client, depending on the so-called consumer offset value stored on the server side. The client may not need to track the offset on its own anymore, but instead, call store_offset() to save it on the server (e.g. after each processed message or the whole batch), or make use of  auto_commit: true, to automatically commit the offset on the server side, once the messages are fetched (this one results in the so called at-most-once delivery mode)."],[654,"Stream"],[2556,"Stream Builder"],[2489,"Stream builder - examples using the IggyStream, IggyStreamProducer, and IggyStreamConsumer builder APIs as discussed in the stream builder guide."],[163,"Stream management"],[1418,"Stream permissions"],[1434,"Stream permissions - per-stream operations (manage stream, read stream, manage topics, read topics, poll messages, send messages)"],[815,"stream_id - the ID of the stream (numeric or string) from which we want to poll the messages."],[1245,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1251,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1253,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1257,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1259,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1262,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1264,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1273,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1276,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1285,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1288,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1292,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1296,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1302,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1309,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1314,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1320,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1325,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1331,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1335,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1339,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1342,"stream_id - variable (Identifier)"],[1347,"stream_id - variable (